{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "instrument": "Rigol DHO804, firmware 00.01.05, SCPI over raw TCP port 5555",
  "purpose": "Differential captures of the factory K-99695 Saturn valve buses at both valve connectors: idle, two controller start-ups, outlet starts and stops, a 22-minute run, temperature, outlet and pause steps, and a controller power cut, plus the connectors' meter readings. See README.md.",
  "controller_contact": "No HTTP requests before 18:38 UTC. Then 41, serialised and at least 5 s apart, all values.cgi, system_info.cgi, quick_shower.cgi or stop_shower.cgi; each run's are in its controller-calls.log. The scope only listened to the buses.",
  "probing": "CH1 on pin 4, CH2 on pin 3, both 10x, grounds on pin 2; valve 2's connector until 18:57 UTC, valve 1's until about 19:30, then valve 2's again. The CH2 probe was off from about 20:36.",
